=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: `except ... as test_total` binds and deletes the name whenever the handler runs
origin: #424, ruling 424 Q4 (b), Q6 (a) - a conditional binder; v0.8.0 reported nothing
=== before: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75
=== after: tests/test_billing.py ===
from app.billing import total


def test_total():
    assert total([50.0, 28.75]) == 78.75


try:
    open("missing.cfg")
except OSError as test_total:
    pass
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "TEST_DISABLED", "severity": "high", "unit": "test_total"}]
